  "ruleText": "Jus 1408.03 Presiding Officer. The presiding officer at an adjudicative hearing conducted under RSA 356-B shall be the senior assistant attorney general in charge of the bureau or any person designated by that senior assistant attorney general.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Jus 1400) #9783-A, eff 9-11-10, EXPIRED: 9-11-18\n\nNew. #12657, INTERIM, eff 11-1-18, EXPIRED: 4-30-19\n\nNew. #12910, eff 10-24-19",
